      "summary": ": Today at Cardrona 13 August 2026 Cardrona is currently closed, with no lifts or terrain open at the time of the latest report. The resort is expecting a mainly fine day with some high cloud, temperatures around 2°C and light winds. Despite the current closed status, the mountain team has been grooming and preparing fresh corduroy for skiing, with Main Basin lifts scheduled from 8:30am and Captains, T-Bar, Soho and Willow’s scheduled to follow from 9:00am. There are several activities taking place on the mountain today, including school skiing with Wanaka Primary, film shoots and race training. The access road is chain-free but has an active road hazard advisory, with thawing conditions making some sections muddy.",
